    "verified": false,
    "collection": "hr_sops",
    "summary": "How housing allowance is calculated and paid.",
    "content": "## Purpose\nHow housing allowance is calculated and paid.\n\n## Entitlement\nHousing allowance is **three months of basic salary per year**, equivalent to 25% of annual basic\nsalary, unless your contract states otherwise. Employees in company-provided accommodation do not\nreceive the allowance.\n\n## Payment options\n1. **Monthly** — added to your monthly payroll by default.\n2. **Annual advance** — paid as a lump sum at the start of the lease year, on request, to cover a\n   landlord demanding a year in advance.\n\n## Requesting the annual advance\n1. Submit a copy of the signed lease contract, in the employee own name.\n2. Compensation and Benefits verifies the lease value and dates.\n3. The advance is paid within **ten working days** of approval.\n4. If you leave the company during the lease year, the unearned portion is recovered from your final\n   settlement.\n\n## Notes\n- The allowance is paid on basic salary, not total package.\n- Leases in a spouse or relative name are not accepted for the advance.\n\n## الغرض\nكيفية احتساب بدل السكن وصرفه.\n\n## الاستحقاق\nبدل السكن يعادل **ثلاثة أشهر من الراتب الأساسي سنوياً** أي ٢٥٪ من الراتب الأساسي السنوي، ما لم ينص العقد على خلاف ذلك.\n\n## خيارات الصرف\n1. **شهرياً** ضمن الراتب، وهو الخيار الافتراضي.\n2. **دفعة سنوية مقدمة** عند الطلب، لتغطية إيجار يطلبه المالك مقدماً.\n\n## ملاحظة\nإذا تركت العمل خلال سنة الإيجار يُسترد الجزء غير المستحق من المخالصة النهائية.",
    "searchText": "Housing Allowance Policy and Claim \nHousing Allowance Policy and Claim \nبدل السكن وآلية صرفه \nبدل السكن وآلية صرفه \nhousing allowance, accommodation, rent, housing advance, annual housing \nبدل سكن, سكن, إيجار, سلفة سكن, بدل السكن السنوي \nbenefits \nSA \n## Purpose\nHow housing allowance is calculated and paid.\n\n## Entitlement\nHousing allowance is **three months of basic salary per year**, equivalent to 25% of annual basic\nsalary, unless your contract states otherwise. Employees in company-provided accommodation do not\nreceive the allowance.\n\n## Payment options\n1. **Monthly** — added to your monthly payroll by default.\n2. **Annual advance** — paid as a lump sum at the start of the lease year, on request, to cover a\n landlord demanding a year in advance.\n\n## Requesting the annual advance\n1. Submit a copy of the signed lease contract, in the employee own name.\n2. Compensation and Benefits verifies the lease value and dates.\n3. The advance is paid within **ten working days** of approval.\n4. If you leave the company during the lease year, the unearned portion is recovered from your final\n settlement.\n\n## Notes\n- The allowance is paid on basic salary, not total package.\n- Leases in a spouse or relative name are not accepted for the advance.\n\n## الغرض\nكيفية احتساب بدل السكن وصرفه.\n\n## الاستحقاق\nبدل السكن يعادل **ثلاثة أشهر من الراتب الأساسي سنوياً** أي ٢٥٪ من الراتب الأساسي السنوي، ما لم ينص العقد على خلاف ذلك.\n\n## خيارات الصرف\n1. **ش",
